---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Contacto | Desde Nuestras Raíces"
	description="Ponte en contacto con Desde Nuestras Raíces a través de Instagram o correo electrónico."
>
	<section class="px-6 pt-16 text-center md:pt-20">
		<p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-oliva">CONTACTO</p>
		<h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-marron md:text-4xl">Estamos aquí para escucharte</h2>
		<p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base text-marron/70 md:text-lg">
			En Desde Nuestras Raíces creemos que cada persona puede contribuir a construir una comunidad más solidaria.
			Si deseas colaborar con nuestros proyectos, participar como voluntario o conocer más sobre nuestra
			propuesta, nos encantaría saber de ti.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-3xl gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
			<a
				href="https://www.instagram.com/nuest.rasraices"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="reveal flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-oliva-suave p-6 transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
			>
				<span class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-oliva text-crema">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
						<path
							d="M12 2.2c3.2 0 3.6 0 4.85.07 1.17.05 2.1.25 2.84.53a5.7 5.7 0 0 1 2.07 1.35 5.7 5.7 0 0 1 1.35 2.07c.28.74.48 1.67.53 2.84.06 1.25.07 1.65.07 4.85s0 3.6-.07 4.85c-.05 1.17-.25 2.1-.53 2.84a5.7 5.7 0 0 1-1.35 2.07 5.7 5.7 0 0 1-2.07 1.35c-.74.28-1.67.48-2.84.53-1.25.06-1.65.07-4.85.07s-3.6 0-4.85-.07c-1.17-.05-2.1-.25-2.84-.53a5.7 5.7 0 0 1-2.07-1.35 5.7 5.7 0 0 1-1.35-2.07c-.28-.74-.48-1.67-.53-2.84C2.21 15.6 2.2 15.2 2.2 12s0-3.6.07-4.85c.05-1.17.25-2.1.53-2.84A5.7 5.7 0 0 1 4.15 2.24 5.7 5.7 0 0 1 6.22.9c.74-.28 1.67-.48 2.84-.53C10.3 2.2 10.7 2.2 12 2.2Zm0 1.8c-3.15 0-3.52 0-4.76.06-.96.04-1.48.2-1.83.34-.46.18-.79.4-1.14.75-.35.35-.57.68-.75 1.14-.14.35-.3.87-.34 1.83C3.12 8.48 3.12 8.85 3.12 12s0 3.52.06 4.76c.04.96.2 1.48.34 1.83.18.46.4.79.75 1.14.35.35.68.57 1.14.75.35.14.87.3 1.83.34 1.24.06 1.61.06 4.76.06s3.52 0 4.76-.06c.96-.04 1.48-.2 1.83-.34.46-.18.79-.4 1.14-.75.35-.35.57-.68.75-1.14.14-.35.3-.87.34-1.83.06-1.24.06-1.61.06-4.76s0-3.52-.06-4.76c-.04-.96-.2-1.48-.34-1.83a3.9 3.9 0 0 0-.75-1.14 3.9 3.9 0 0 0-1.14-.75c-.35-.14-.87-.3-1.83-.34C15.52 3.12 15.15 3.12 12 3.12Zm0 3.42a5.46 5.46 0 1 1 0 10.92 5.46 5.46 0 0 1 0-10.92Zm0 1.8a3.66 3.66 0 1 0 0 7.32 3.66 3.66 0 0 0 0-7.32Zm5.88-3.6a1.26 1.26 0 1 1 0 2.52 1.26 1.26 0 0 1 0-2.52Z"
						/>
					</svg>
				</span>
				<span>
					<span class="block text-sm font-medium text-marron/60">Instagram</span>
					<span class="block font-semibold text-marron">@nuest.rasraices</span>
				</span>
			</a>

			<a
				href="mailto:desdenuestrasraices@gmail.com"
				class="reveal flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-terracota-suave p-6 transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
				style="transition-delay: 80ms"
			>
				<span class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-terracota text-crema">
					<svg
						xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
						class="h-6 w-6"
						fill="none"
						viewBox="0 0 24 24"
						stroke="currentColor"
						stroke-width="2"
					>
						<path
							stroke-linecap="round"
							stroke-linejoin="round"
							d="M3 7.5l8.4 5.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.2 0L21 7.5M5 19h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v10a2 2 0 0 0 2 2Z"
						/>
					</svg>
				</span>
				<span class="min-w-0">
					<span class="block text-sm font-medium text-marron/60">Correo</span>
					<span class="block truncate font-semibold text-marron">desdenuestrasraices@gmail.com</span>
				</span>
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
